[{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"1 厘米大约有多长？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"指甲盖的宽度大约是 1 厘米"},{"key":"B","text":"教室大约长 1 厘米"},{"key":"C","text":"一支铅笔大约长 1 厘米"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"1 厘米很短，大约是指甲盖的宽度。","verify":"'指甲盖的宽度大约是 1 厘米'","id":"cnm_p040_q1","topicId":"cnm_p040"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"小棒一端对准直尺上的 0，另一端对准 4。这根小棒长多少厘米？","answer":"4","explanation":"从 0 到 4，长 4 厘米。","verify":"4","id":"cnm_p040_q2","topicId":"cnm_p040"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"两根小棒分别长 3 厘米和 2 厘米，首尾接在一起。一共长多少厘米？","answer":"5","explanation":"3＋2＝5（厘米）。","verify":"3+2","id":"cnm_p040_q3","topicId":"cnm_p040"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"直尺上，小棒一端对着 2 厘米，另一端对着 7 厘米。这根小棒长多少厘米？","answer":"5","explanation":"不能只读 7。长度是 7－2＝5 厘米。","verify":"7-2","id":"cnm_p040_q4","topicId":"cnm_p040"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"1 米等于多少厘米？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"100厘米"},{"key":"B","text":"10厘米"},{"key":"C","text":"1000厘米"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"1 米＝100 厘米。","verify":"'100厘米'","id":"cnm_p041_q1","topicId":"cnm_p041"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"2 米是多少厘米？","answer":"200","explanation":"2×100＝200（厘米）。","verify":"2*100","id":"cnm_p041_q2","topicId":"cnm_p041"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"4 米是多少厘米？","answer":"400","explanation":"4×100＝400（厘米）。","verify":"4*100","id":"cnm_p041_q3","topicId":"cnm_p041"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"旗杆高 2 米，讲台长 50 厘米。旗杆比讲台高多少厘米？先把 2 米化成厘米。","answer":"150","explanation":"2 米＝200 厘米，200－50＝150 厘米。","verify":"2*100-50","id":"cnm_p041_q4","topicId":"cnm_p041"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"直尺上两个刻度点之间的那一段，可以看成什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"线段"},{"key":"B","text":"一个圆"},{"key":"C","text":"一个角"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"有两个端点的一段是线段。","verify":"'线段'","id":"cnm_p265_q1","topicId":"cnm_p265"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"线段有几个端点？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"2个"